  contraband: []
  boothLines:
  - "\xA1Buenas tardes, ciudadano! I am EL HURAC\xC1N DE HERMOSILLO! Three-time champion
    of the Arena Coliseo!"
  - The mask stays on. The mask ALWAYS stays on. My own mother has not seen my face
    since 1998. She says thank God.
  - The registration? In my name. My TRUE name. The one the people chant. The other
    name is for the government.
  - Tonight I fight El Gringo Loco in El Paso. He's from Lubbock. Very loco. He does
    taxes the rest of the week.
  lineIfApproved: "\xA1EL HURAC\xC1N AGRADECE! The ring awaits!"
  lineIfRejected: "The Hurac\xE1n... retreats. A STRATEGIC retreat. Tell El Gringo
    Loco he got lucky."
  lineIfImprisoned: "You cannot cage a HURAC\xC1N! ...Okay, you can. Can I keep the
    mask on? It's very important to me."
  onlyIfApproved: {fileID: 0}
